<span class="printed" data-width="43.874" style="left:205.429px;top:176.662px;font-size:11.046px;font-weight:400;color:#231f20">주식회사  </span>
<span class="printed" data-width="61.961" style="left:249.036px;top:170.372px;font-size:18.194px;font-weight:700;color:#231f20">하나은행</span>
<span class="printed" data-width="9.69" style="left:313.513px;top:176.662px;font-size:11.046px;font-weight:400;color:#231f20">앞</span>
